{"seq":2,"slug":"expiry-alert-engine-escalation-workflow","title":"效期预警引擎、分级升级与处置工作流","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/lot-batch-expiry-fefo-traceability-management/shelf-life-monitoring-alert/expiry-alert-engine-escalation-workflow","wordCount":3150,"readingTime":13,"html":"<h1 id=\"效期预警引擎-分级升级与处置工作流\">效期预警引擎、分级升级与处置工作流</h1><p>一批还剩 45 天到期的冷藏黄油静静躺在 3 号库位，系统里有正确的到期日，拣货也走 FEFO，但它一直没被卖出去——因为没有任何机制在它进入近效期时叫醒某个人。效期预警引擎要解决的正是这个问题：把<a href=\"../lot-expiry-data-model/lot-batch-code-expiry-attribute-model\">批次的效期属性</a>从只读数据变成一串按时间自动触发、带分级、有责任人、能追踪处置结果的事件流。它不是报表，也不是&quot;还有 X 天到期&quot;的看板，而是一条从扫描到升级、再到处置闭环的流水线。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>效期预警引擎的本质是<strong>时间驱动的规则求值 + 分级路由 + 状态机闭环</strong>。时间驱动指它每天（或每小时）对全体在库批次求值剩余货架期；分级路由指不同紧迫度落到不同角色、走不同渠道、有不同响应时限；状态机闭环指一条预警从产生到关闭有明确状态迁移，且关闭必须绑定真实处置动作（卖出、调拨、退供、报废），而非&quot;我知道了&quot;。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[调度器触发扫描&lt;br/&gt;每日/每小时] --&gt; B[拉取在库批次&lt;br/&gt;含 exp 与状态]&#10;  B --&gt; C[计算剩余货架期 RSL&lt;br/&gt;与阈值带比对]&#10;  C --&gt; D{落在哪个档位?}&#10;  D -- 未触发 --&gt; Z[跳过]&#10;  D -- 触发 --&gt; E[生成预警事件&lt;br/&gt;幂等键去重]&#10;  E --&gt; F[抑制规则过滤&lt;br/&gt;已有处置中/召回锁定]&#10;  F --&gt; G[按档位路由到责任人&lt;br/&gt;站内信/邮件/IM]&#10;  G --&gt; H{在 SLA 内确认?}&#10;  H -- 是 --&gt; I[进入处置流程&lt;br/&gt;促销/调拨/退供/报废]&#10;  H -- 否 --&gt; J[升级到上级&lt;br/&gt;并记升级次数]&#10;  I --&gt; K[处置结果回写&lt;br/&gt;关闭预警并留痕]\">flowchart TD\n  A[调度器触发扫描&lt;br/&gt;每日/每小时] --&gt; B[拉取在库批次&lt;br/&gt;含 exp 与状态]\n  B --&gt; C[计算剩余货架期 RSL&lt;br/&gt;与阈值带比对]\n  C --&gt; D{落在哪个档位?}\n  D -- 未触发 --&gt; Z[跳过]\n  D -- 触发 --&gt; E[生成预警事件&lt;br/&gt;幂等键去重]\n  E --&gt; F[抑制规则过滤&lt;br/&gt;已有处置中/召回锁定]\n  F --&gt; G[按档位路由到责任人&lt;br/&gt;站内信/邮件/IM]\n  G --&gt; H{在 SLA 内确认?}\n  H -- 是 --&gt; I[进入处置流程&lt;br/&gt;促销/调拨/退供/报废]\n  H -- 否 --&gt; J[升级到上级&lt;br/&gt;并记升级次数]\n  I --&gt; K[处置结果回写&lt;br/&gt;关闭预警并留痕]</pre><p>把引擎和&quot;报表&quot;对比，差别不在有没有图表，而在<strong>谁被要求采取行动、行动是否被约束</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>效期报表</th>\n<th>效期预警引擎</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>触发方式</td>\n<td>人主动查看</td>\n<td>时间/事件自动触发</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>输出</td>\n<td>数字与图表</td>\n<td>带责任人与 SLA 的任务</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分级</td>\n<td>通常无</td>\n<td>按 RSL 分档，不同档不同动作</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>去重</td>\n<td>每次刷新重新显示</td>\n<td>幂等键，同批次同档只产生一条</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>闭环</td>\n<td>无状态</td>\n<td>状态机，关闭需绑定处置动作</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>判断引擎是否&quot;真的在工作&quot;，最直接的标准是：<strong>它产生的预警是否都有人被指派、并且能追到最终处置方式</strong>。如果一条预警两周后还停在&quot;已发送&quot;，那这套系统只是把报表换了界面。</p>\n<h2 id=\"剩余货架期与分级预警模型\">剩余货架期与分级预警模型</h2><p>分级的数学基础是剩余货架期。设批次 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>l</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">l</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span> 到期日 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>exp</mtext><mi>l</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{exp}_l</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6747em;vertical-align:-0.2441em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">exp</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.242em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、当前时刻 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span>，则剩余货架期（Remaining Shelf Life）<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>RSL</mtext><mi>l</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mtext>exp</mtext><mi>l</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{RSL}_l(t) = \\text{exp}_l - t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">RSL</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8275em;vertical-align:-0.2441em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">exp</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.242em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span>。单看绝对天数会在长短保质期商品间失衡：剩 60 天对总保质期 18 个月的罐头充裕，对总保质期 90 天的高温鲜奶已是危险信号。因此分级同时看<strong>绝对天数</strong>与<strong>剩余比例</strong>，设总保质期 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>TSL</mtext><mi>l</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mtext>exp</mtext><mi>l</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mtext>mfg</mtext><mi>l</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{TSL}_l = \\text{exp}_l - \\text{mfg}_l</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">TSL</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8275em;vertical-align:-0.2441em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">exp</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.242em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9386em;vertical-align:-0.2441em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">mfg</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.242em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>ρ</mi><mi>l</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mtext>RSL</mtext><mi>l</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mtext>TSL</mtext><mi>l</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho_l(t) = \\text{RSL}_l(t) / \\text{TSL}_l</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">RSL</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">TSL</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。进入某档的条件是&quot;绝对天数低于阈值&quot;<strong>或</strong>&quot;剩余比例低于阈值&quot;——取先到者，能同时接住短保生鲜与长保标品：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>tier</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>l</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>i</mi><mo>:</mo><msub><mtext>RSL</mtext><mi>l</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>≤</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mtext> </mtext><mo>∨</mo><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>ρ</mi><mi>l</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>≤</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mtext> </mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{tier}(l,t) = \\min\\{\\,i : \\text{RSL}_l(t) \\le d_i \\ \\lor\\ \\rho_l(t) \\le r_i\\,\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">tier</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">RSL</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∨</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 档的天数阈值与比例阈值。零售渠道的&quot;三分之一/三分之二规则&quot;就是把这套比例阈值同时用在收货验收与在库预警两端：收货时剩余保质期不得少于总保质期的三分之二，在库降到三分之一即进入近效期。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>档位</th>\n<th>典型触发条件</th>\n<th>责任人</th>\n<th>主要处置动作</th>\n<th>响应 SLA</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>关注（Tier 4）</td>\n<td>剩余比例 ≤ 1/2</td>\n<td>品类/采购</td>\n<td>纳入促销计划、调整补货</td>\n<td>7 天</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>预警（Tier 3）</td>\n<td>剩余比例 ≤ 1/3 或 ≤ 90 天</td>\n<td>品类经理</td>\n<td>折扣去化、跨店调拨</td>\n<td>3 天</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>紧急（Tier 2）</td>\n<td>剩余比例 ≤ 1/5 或 ≤ 30 天</td>\n<td>门店/仓储主管</td>\n<td>捆绑、折扣渠道转移、退供谈判</td>\n<td>1 天</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>临期（Tier 1）</td>\n<td>剩余 ≤ 7 天或低于 MRSL</td>\n<td>值班负责人</td>\n<td>下架、捐赠、报废待审</td>\n<td>当日</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>过期（Tier 0）</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>RSL</mtext><mi>l</mi></msub><mo>≤</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{RSL}_l \\le 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">RSL</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>质量/合规</td>\n<td>冻结、移入不合格品区、销毁</td>\n<td>立即</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>阈值必须<strong>按品类与渠道分别维护</strong>，而非全局常数。生鲜、冷链、处方药、化妆品、长保标品的衰减速度与监管敏感度差异极大：药品在《药品经营质量管理规范》（GSP，国家药监局）体系下对近效期有按月催销与不合格品管理要求，临期划分常按有效期长短分段；食品端更多依赖企业自定临期标准与《反食品浪费法》对临期食品销售标注的约束。跨境场景还要叠加目的地规则——欧盟《食品信息条例》(EU) No 1169/2011 对&quot;最佳食用期&quot;（best before）与&quot;此日期前食用&quot;（use by）的区分，直接影响哪类商品该用哪档阈值。</p>\n<h2 id=\"扫描调度-幂等去重与告警抑制\">扫描调度、幂等去重与告警抑制</h2><p>引擎最容易出问题的地方不是阈值算错，而是<strong>同一条预警被重复轰炸</strong>。若每天扫一次、每次都为同一批次生成一条&quot;还剩 12 天&quot;，责任人的收件箱五天就堆满同一批货的五条消息，结果是所有人开始忽略预警——这就是告警疲劳。工程上必须给每条预警一个稳定的幂等键，最自然的选择是三元组 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>key</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>e</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>lot_id</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> tier</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> 有效期事件窗口</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{key}(e) = (\\text{lot\\_id},\\ \\text{tier},\\ \\text{有效期事件窗口})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">key</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.06em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">lot_id</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">tier</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">有效期事件窗口</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>：同一批次在同一档位内<strong>只产生一条</strong>预警，直到降到下一档才产生新的一条。实现上通常给预警记录一个&quot;当前档位&quot;字段，扫描时比较新档位与已记录档位，只在档位下降时更新并触发新通知。</p>\n<p>调度架构有两种取舍。<strong>全量批扫描</strong>每天固定时间对在库批次求值，简单、可重放、便于日报，代价是实时性差——批次可能在两次扫描间被卖掉或刚过期。<strong>增量/事件驱动</strong>在入库、出库、盘点、临期状态变更时触发局部重算，配合每日全量兜底，实时性好但要处理乱序与补偿。跨境仓库多用混合模式：全量扫描负责合规与日报口径，事件触发负责下架冻结等时效敏感动作。</p>\n<p>抑制规则（suppression）与去重不同，它处理&quot;这批货现在不该被预警&quot;：已召回冻结、调拨途中、标记为捐赠待运、处于质量隔离区的批次都从候选集排除，避免对同一问题喊两次。抑制必须带<strong>过期时间</strong>，否则一次临时冻结会把批次永久静音，冻结解除后预警再也不来，货就在无声中过期。</p>\n<p>扫描引擎的健康度要用<strong>预警精度</strong>而非数量衡量。可观测指标至少包括：去重率、抑制命中率、按时确认率（SLA 达标率）、预警到处置的平均时长，以及&quot;过期未预警&quot;的漏报数——后者最该被追责，一条都没预警出来的过期往往意味着某段扫描逻辑静默失效。</p>\n<h2 id=\"分级升级工作流与处置动作\">分级升级工作流与处置动作</h2><p>一条预警的完整生命周期是一条状态机，而非一次通知。典型状态包括：<code>OPEN</code>（已生成未确认）→ <code>ACK</code>（责任人认领）→ <code>IN_PROGRESS</code>（处置中）→ <code>RESOLVED</code>（完成并留痕）/ <code>EXPIRED</code>（超时未处置）；升级（<code>ESCALATED</code>）是超时后附加的标记，而非独立终点。状态迁移必须由事件驱动并全部落库，否则&quot;谁在何时认领、拖了多久&quot;无从追溯。升级链的原则是<strong>逐级、可配置、有次数上限</strong>。第一级通常是直接责任人（品类经理/门店主管），超时未确认则升到上级（区域经理），再超时升到合规或供应链负责人。每次升级记录触发原因（超时/金额超阈/受监管类目）与升级次数。药品、冷链、婴幼儿配方等强监管品类往往配置<strong>更短的第一级 SLA</strong> 与<strong>更高的升级权重</strong>——临期处方药与临期纸巾不该共用一个响应时钟。升级不是惩罚，而是把资源自动导向真正有风险的库存。</p>\n<p>处置动作本身需要一个字典表，把&quot;临期了怎么办&quot;从口头经验变成可执行的选项，并约束每个选项的适用边界：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>处置动作</th>\n<th>适用档位</th>\n<th>前置约束</th>\n<th>留痕字段</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>促销/折扣去化</td>\n<td>Tier 3-1</td>\n<td>非召回锁定、允许改价</td>\n<td>活动号、折扣率、批次</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>跨店/跨仓调拨</td>\n<td>Tier 4-2</td>\n<td>目标仓有需求且效期可接受</td>\n<td>调拨单号、目标仓、时效</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>退供/换货</td>\n<td>Tier 3-2</td>\n<td>合同允许、在质保期内</td>\n<td>供应商、协议条款、批次</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>降级渠道转移</td>\n<td>Tier 3-1</td>\n<td>渠道剩余货架期要求满足</td>\n<td>渠道代码、MRSL 校验</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>捐赠</td>\n<td>Tier 1</td>\n<td>未过期、符合受赠方要求</td>\n<td>受赠机构、食品合规证明</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>报废/销毁</td>\n<td>Tier 0-1</td>\n<td>已过有效期或不可售</td>\n<td>销毁单号、监销人、方式</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>选哪个动作不靠拍脑袋，而是<strong>效期、成本与约束的联合判断</strong>。一批剩 5 天的近效期商品，若调拨到另一城市需 3 天运输、到达时只剩 2 天，调拨就是错的；若它已在召回范围内，任何销售动作都违规，只能冻结待处理。因此处置动作推荐应内嵌 MRSL（最小剩余货架期）校验——分配端 <a href=\"../fefo-picking-expiry-allocation/fefo-ordering-expiry-priority-principle\">FEFO 分配原理</a> 里对可售池的分层逻辑，在处置端同样适用。</p>\n<h2 id=\"处置闭环-合规留痕与成本口径\">处置闭环、合规留痕与成本口径</h2><p>预警的真正价值只在闭环里体现。&quot;已促销&quot;&quot;已调拨&quot;这类口头结论不算闭环，闭环要求<strong>处置动作回写到批次库存台账并产生可核验凭证</strong>：促销要有活动号与改价记录，调拨要有出库与到货确认，退供要有供应商签收，报废要有销毁单与监销记录。任何一条预警在关闭时若找不到对应凭证，都应被视为&quot;伪关闭&quot;，在下一次扫描中被重新打开。</p>\n<p>合规留痕是跨境生鲜与医药场景的硬约束而非加分项。药品流通端，GSP 要求企业对近效期药品按期催销、对不合格品设专门区域并记录处理，销毁需有记录；食品端，《食品安全法》与各地临期食品销售规范要求临期食品单独标示或以显著方式提示消费者，报废处理需符合废弃物管理要求。国际上，美国 FDA 的《食品安全现代化法》追溯规则（FSMA 204）对特定食品要求在关键追踪事件（CTE）上记录批号与位置；欧盟《药品良好分销规范》（EU GDP Guidelines, 2013/C 343/01）要求分销环节对临期产品有明确处理与隔离程序；美国《药品供应链安全法》（DSCSA）要求交易信息可溯源。共同指向是：<strong>临期与过期的处置需要是外部可审计的证据链。</strong></p>\n<p>成本口径决定预警系统是否真被业务采纳。报废损失、促销折让、调拨运费、退供折价都是钱，若预警只报告&quot;有 200 个批次临期&quot;却不给金额，采购与财务不会认真对待。引擎应把每条预警与金额绑定（批次数量 × 单位成本），按档位聚合出&quot;未来 30 天预计报废金额&quot;。当升级规则以金额为触发条件之一，系统就从&quot;消息提醒&quot;变成&quot;财务风险控制&quot;。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>效期预警引擎 = 时间驱动扫描 + 分级路由 + 状态机闭环；没有责任人、没有处置动作的，只是换了界面的报表。</li>\n<li>分级同时看绝对天数与剩余比例，取先到者；阈值按品类与渠道分别维护，跨境场景叠加目的地规则（EU 1169/2011、FDA FSMA 204、EU GDP、GSP/DSCSA）。</li>\n<li>幂等键 <code>(批次, 档位, 窗口)</code> 保证同批次同档只产生一条预警；抑制规则必须带过期时间，否则造成静默漏报。</li>\n<li>升级链逐级、可配置、有次数上限；受监管品类用更短 SLA 与更高升级权重。</li>\n<li>处置动作是受约束的字典表（促销/调拨/退供/降级渠道/捐赠/报废），推荐时必须内嵌 MRSL 校验。</li>\n<li>闭环 = 处置动作回写台账并产生凭证，无凭证的关闭是伪关闭；用金额口径衡量价值，把系统从消息提醒升级为财务风险控制。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"效期预警引擎、分级升级与处置工作流","id":"效期预警引擎-分级升级与处置工作流"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"剩余货架期与分级预警模型","id":"剩余货架期与分级预警模型"},{"level":2,"text":"扫描调度、幂等去重与告警抑制","id":"扫描调度-幂等去重与告警抑制"},{"level":2,"text":"分级升级工作流与处置动作","id":"分级升级工作流与处置动作"},{"level":2,"text":"处置闭环、合规留痕与成本口径","id":"处置闭环-合规留痕与成本口径"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"剩余保质期度量与预警阈值模型（PSL/发货时效门槛）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/lot-batch-expiry-fefo-traceability-management/shelf-life-monitoring-alert/remaining-shelf-life-metric-threshold"},"next":{"title":"近效期降价促销、清库策略与过期报废处置","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/lot-batch-expiry-fefo-traceability-management/shelf-life-monitoring-alert/near-expiry-markdown-clearance-disposal"}}